# Keeps the build context for packages/agent-worker/Dockerfile (and any later
# image built from the repo root) down to source. Everything here is either
# regenerated inside the image (node_modules via pnpm install) or has no
# business in one (VCS state, local env, build output, caches).
.git
.github/docker
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
.stella
.agent
.ds-sync
ds-bundle
docs/brand_old
**/*.log
